# Test suite
#
# Everything built in tests/ is a compiled binary with no extension, so
# ignore the directory's contents and add the source forms back.  The
# inverse — listing the binaries — needs a new line for every test, and
# one forgotten line commits a binary.
/tests/*
!/tests/*.am
!/tests/*.c
!/tests/*.h
!/tests/*.py
!/tests/*.sh

# Distribution tarballs
*.tar.gz
*.tar.bz2
*.tar.xz

